cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Nexus ShadowScan
message: >-
  If you use Nexus ShadowScan in research or an internal security
  program, please cite this repository.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Nexus ShadowScan contributors
    website: https://github.com/aisecnomad/Nexus-ShadowScan
repository-code: https://github.com/aisecnomad/Nexus-ShadowScan
url: https://github.com/aisecnomad/Nexus-ShadowScan/tree/main/docs
abstract: >-
  ShadowScan discovers evidence of AI agents and related
  integrations across code repositories, identity providers,
  LLM gateway logs, low-code platforms, SaaS apps, cloud
  accounts, endpoints, network logs, and running processes,
  then reconciles findings against an approved inventory of
  Agent Cards.
keywords:
  - shadow-ai
  - ai-agents
  - agent-discovery
  - ai-security
  - ai-governance
  - ai-inventory
  - mcp
  - sarif
  - cyclonedx
